# Production build config for task.mico360.com.
# Same-origin API path — nginx on task.mico360.com proxies /api, /socket.io and /uploads to the
# backend (see deploy/nginx/task.mico360.com.conf), so the app needs no cross-origin API host.
# VITE_* values are PUBLIC (compiled into the client bundle) — never put secrets here.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
